msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Home canning" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether it was something practiced in your family or something you took it up"
" to extend the shelf life of your groceries, you know how to preserve produce"
" and meat in cans or mason jars.  With the electricity down and refrigerators"
" dead, saying your skills could come in handy is an understatement."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Home canning" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
