#. ~ Description of profession "Street Fighting (Intermediate)" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been in quite a few fights in the street.  You can throw and dodge a "
"punch better than most."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Street Fighting (Intermediate)" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
