#. ~ Description of profession "Street Fighting (Expert)" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Maybe you're the muscle of some criminal gang, maybe you're a bouncer at a "
"club, or maybe you're just a huge asshole.  You've constantly been getting "
"into fights with strangers on the streets for most of your life, and somehow "
"you ain't dead yet, so you must be doing something right."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Street Fighting (Expert)" for female
