#. ~ Description of profession "Fencing (Expert)" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've spent so long practicing your fencing you wouldn't look out of place "
"in the Renaissance dueling with ne'er-do-wells and rapscallions.  En Garde!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Fencing (Expert)" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
