msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Racing" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a real speed demon in anything with an engine!  Pulling off hairpin "
"turns at high speeds is a difficult skill to master but you can drift with "
"the best of them."
msgstr ""

